sentences.l:
“Eurymachus, in no way is it possible well-famed throughout the land
to be, those who indeed a house dishonouring devour
of a man who is best;

But going into the house, tend to your own tasks,
the loom and the distaff, and to the handmaids give orders
to ply their work;

soon not well to all will you give way,
lest you, even younger though I am, to the field I chase,
pelting with stones;

So he spoke, and they then all at him sweetly laughed,
the suitors, and indeed they let go of harsh anger
at Telemachus;

That, on the bow-grip taking, he drew the string and the notches,
from the very spot, from the stool, sitting, and he let fly the arrow,
aiming straight,

and of the axes he did not miss, of all,
the first haft-hole, and right through went outdoors
the arrow, bronze-heavy;

“Telemachus, not you the stranger in the halls puts to shame
sitting, nor of the mark at all did I miss, nor at all the bow
long did I toil stringing;
